      it
    }
    actor/attribute
    ~~ Weak parent ID is resolved to the owning task object while registered.
    parent-id/getter
    parent/it-method{
      @parent-id >parent-id-value
      if: ( $parent-id-value > 0 ) then: {
        $parent-id-value 1 - l9-task-registry array.get
      } else: { _ };
    }
    label/attribute
    ~~ 2026-11-23 - GPT-6 under Jean Hugues Noel Robert.
    ~~ The constructor stores :id, but task.id had no getter.
    id/getter
    paused?/getter
    queued?/getter
    should-stop?/getter
    stopping?/it-method{ ( @should-stop? and not @done ) }
    done?/getter
    pending-error?/getter
    stopped?/method{ .$done? }
    cancel/it-method{
      return-if( @done? or @canceled? )
      true @canceled?!
