    ip/it-method{ @actor.ip }
    data-stack/it-method{ @actor.data-stack }
    control-stack/it-method{ @actor.control-stack }
    tos/it-method{ @actor.tos }
    csp/it-method{ @actor.csp }
    ~~ 2026-11-24: GPT-6 coding agent under Jean Hugues Noel Robert.
    ~~ The local FIFO owns ready tasks while queued. A wake is idempotent;
    ~~ paused/canceled/done tasks do not enter the queue, and dequeue clears
